    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1h2nze3\" data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"432\">WebRush &mdash; 6-Hour Frontend Hackathon</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"585\"><strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"445\">WebRush</strong> is a fully online, individual frontend hackathon where participants get <strong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"584\">6 hours to build a complete web solution for a given challenge</strong>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"655\">But there&rsquo;s a twist &mdash; <strong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"655\">you don't get just one shot at your score.</strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"dodmdf\" data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"676\">The Challenge</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"783\">At the beginning of the hackathon, <strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"745\">one common problem statement</strong> will be provided to all participants.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"889\">Your task is to design and develop the best possible frontend solution within the <strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"888\">6-hour time limit</strong>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"1041\">You can choose your own approach, design, frontend framework, libraries, and tools &mdash; but your final submission must follow the challenge requirements.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"wc62oz\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1085\">Automated Evaluation with FAIE Engine</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1211\">Your project will be evaluated automatically using the <strong data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1157\">FAIE Engine</strong>, an automated frontend evaluation and scoring system.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1255\">The evaluation focuses on aspects such as:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1463\">\n<li data-section-id=\"16u35jd\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1281\">UI/UX &amp; Visual Quality</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"d50rfv\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1317\">Required Features &amp; Functionality</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3faenv\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1344\">Code Quality &amp; Structure</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1bjge1r\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1361\">Responsiveness</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"858wt4\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1391\">Accessibility &amp; Performance</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mc3iun\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1415\">Project Documentation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rpiufp\" data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1463\">Overall implementation of the given challenge</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1587\"><strong data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1517\">No manual judging panel is required for scoring.</strong> Your submission is analyzed and scored through the evaluation engine.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1aszp9i\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1626\">3 Chances to Improve Your Score</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1744\">Every participant gets <strong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1706\">up to 3 chances to submit and improve their project</strong> during the allowed submission window.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1787\">You can use these attempts strategically:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1830\"><strong data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1830\">Build &rarr; Evaluate &rarr; Improve &rarr; Resubmit</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1957\">Each evaluation provides a score, allowing you to identify areas that need improvement and work towards a better final score.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2033\">Your <strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1987\">highest valid score</strong> will be considered for the final leaderboard.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"w1ahmd\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2068\">Leaderboard = Final Results</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2159\">This isn't just about completing the challenge &mdash; <strong data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2159\">your score determines your position.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2256\">Participants will be ranked on the <strong data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2255\">final leaderboard based on their highest achieved score</strong>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2397\"><strong data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2286\">Highest Rank &rarr; Winner</strong><br data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2289\" /><strong data-start=\"2292\" data-end=\"2327\">Second Highest Rank &rarr; Runner-Up</strong><br data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2330\" /><strong data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2397\">Other top-ranked participants &rarr; As per the final leaderboard</strong></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1mdxq18\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2422\">️ Technology Rules</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2791\">\n<li data-section-id=\"zyf6rm\" data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2456\">Individual participation only.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1withni\" data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2482\">Fully online hackathon.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ut80i7\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2511\">Frontend development only.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19arbon\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2597\">Modern frontend frameworks, libraries, UI tools, and development tools are allowed.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"p2tsv8\" data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2668\"><strong data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2668\">Backend technologies and backend implementation are not allowed.</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9it6vq\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2742\">The project must be developed within the <strong data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2741\">6-hour hackathon duration</strong>.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1vmnqnx\" data-start=\"2743\" data-end=\"2791\">Previously built projects cannot be submitted.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"w2282c\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2809\">Submission</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2836\">Participants will submit:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2908\">\n<li data-section-id=\"su2qsv\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2861\">Live deployed website</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1n6385r\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2881\">GitHub repository</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hz41na\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2908\">Required project details</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2979\">All submissions must be made within the specified hackathon timeline.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1mf97w2\" data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3045\">One Challenge. Six Hours. Three Chances. One Leaderboard.</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3120\"><strong data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3120\">Build fast. Get evaluated. Improve your score. Climb the leaderboard.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3145\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3145\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Welcome to WebRush.</strong></p>",
